             Wordo v2.31 README File by Dotoran of Frontiers!
============================================================================

    To set this version of the game up, do the following:

1. Move the "Wordo/" directory somewhere in your system. A good possibility
   might be your "Doors:" directory.

2. Add the "Wordo" ARexx file as an object/pfile item somewhere on your BBS.

3. You can also choose to add the "WordoDocs" ARexx file as another object/
   pfile item if you wish the users to be able to read the documentation,
   without having to load the game itself.

4. Only User ID # 1, or a user with the same Access Group as User ID # 1 will
   be able to use the MAINTENANCE features of this game.

    That's It!

    That's all I'm going to say in this "READ_ME" file. The documentation
file is VERY extensive, and should be able to answer any questions you may
have concerning game play. Please read ALL the instructions, for this is
NOT an EASY game to play.

